  "details": "1. Receive a Group Invite from a user (who I presume already is full on groups)\n\n2. Accept a Group Invite in Client\n\n3. It looks like it accepts, no prompts showing an error\n\n4. It shows back up the next time you log back into VRC client\n\n5. Accept Group Invite on website\n\n6. Receive Error: {user{ can't join right now because they're in too many groups․\n\nUnsure how to replicate as I do not know many users who are full of groups, but this seems to be replicable on Desktop (I do not have the devices to test on Android/etc).",
